    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 5449e26e0b7790d57e4b895aea95ca564005d70e -->\nDelta re-check (read-only, not rebuilt): the new head 5449e26e is the result of two merges of main plus one small test-comment commit, all added since our review at 2756f724.\n\n**Ready for the maintainer to merge.** A maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n\nWhat holds:\n- `a6e9309a` (merge of main 09720ae3 into 2756f724): 25 test files and `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`. Against main, every changed line in the crate files is a `//` comment line, so no test code was dropped or altered.\n- `crates/app/tests/solid_law_goldens.rs` was the hand-resolved file (gate map header). Both sides are kept: main's `motion::machining2d` / `motion::drilling` rename is applied, and this PR's `sim::verify` gate-map text is kept. Header comment only.\n- `8d139e09` (non-merge, `test(gate): lathe_cycle_exit gate map names post::post`): one line in `crates/app/tests/lathe_cycle_exit.rs`, a `//!` header comment (`app::post` to `post::post`). Comment only; no delta concern.\n- `5449e26e` (merge of main 5bdfc00c): `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` only, plus the merge itself.\n- `crates/sim/tests/boundary_arc_walls.rs` differs from main only in a `//!` gate-map comment.\n- `git diff origin/main...5449e26e` lists only this PR's own files: `xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs` (new), `xtask/src/main.rs`, `docs/decisions/922-gate-maps.md`, plus the comment-only header edits. No snapshot PNG, no workflow file.\n- `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` reads `19` (LF ending) at this head; main reads `18`, so the bump ends above main as AGENTS.md requires. Note for the merger: PR #1151 also bumps to 19. Whichever merges second takes 20.\n- GitHub reports MERGEABLE.\n\nNot re-run here: the gate was not rebuilt in this delta check. The test-header comments do not change behaviour.\n",
